# Search-tool ignores (ripgrep, fd, ag). NOT a gitignore: these files stay tracked.
# Generated or build output that repo-wide searches hit before real code
# (prisma/generated alone is ~17MB across ~145 files). Search them explicitly
# with `rg -uu <pattern> <path>` when that is what you need.
prisma/generated/
stats.html
artifacts/
package-lock.json
